 ],
 "says": "A person selects two places in the checkout of repository W: docs/adr (required) and README.md (optional). source.observe reads only files under those two roots and writes nothing. A selection whose root climbs out of the checkout into a neighbouring repository (../neighbouring-repository/docs) is refused at admission and nothing is read. A selection whose required root docs/decisions is absent returns an observation that lists that root as missing, with ref_unavailable at /roots/0, instead of an empty read. With the checkout bound and a decisions source registered and committed, a capture of an ADR the observation read is stored as a draft; a capture that names the same observation but claims its input came from records 12 to 18 of a session transcript that no selection named is refused with input_not_observed at /processing/inputs/0 and nothing is stored. No step reads a path, repository, transcript or companion file outside what the person selected.",
